4696 {\cf17 static} {\cf18 int} stbi__create_png_image_raw(stbi__png *a, stbi_uc *raw, stbi__uint32 raw_len, {\cf18 int} out_n, stbi__uint32 x, stbi__uint32 y, {\cf18 int} depth, {\cf18 int} color)\par
