5392 {\cf20 // extract an arbitrarily-aligned N-bit value (N=bits)}\par
5393 {\cf20 // from v, and then make it 8-bits long and fractionally}\par
5394 {\cf20 // extend it to full full range.}\par
5395 {\cf17 static} {\cf18 int} stbi__shiftsigned({\cf18 unsigned} {\cf18 int} v, {\cf18 int} shift, {\cf18 int} bits)\par
